OL,3,GNEWSARough sleeper pledge a 'big task'
OL,4,Afor rural areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's promise
OL,7,Fto offer every rough sleeper in England
OL,8,Faccommodation by Christmas is "a very
OL,9,Fbig task" in rural areas, according to
OL,10,Fone homelessness charity.
OL,12,FAlongside, which works in the West of
OL,13,FEngland, said Burnham's ambition was
OL,14,F"laudable and very important" but the
OL,15,Fchallenge would be turning it into
OL,16,Freality.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
