OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSARough sleeper pledge a 'big task'
OL,4,Afor rural areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FZoe Conn, fundraising and development
OL,7,Fdirector for Alongside, said rough
OL,8,Fsleeping was harder to spot in rural
OL,9,Fareas which made offering people a bed
OL,10,Fharder "because you need to find people
OL,11,Ffirst - you need to reach them where
OL,12,Fthey are".
OL,14,FSomerset Council has been awarded
OL,15,F#5.87m over the next three years by the
OL,16,Fgovernment's rough sleeping programme.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
